==============================================================================
                               OMF 2097 CD Readme
==============================================================================

Thank you for purchasing the One Must Fall 2097 CD.  The CD version of OMF
has a few minor differences from the disk version, noted below.


Install program
---------------

To install OMF:

  1. Place the CD in your CD-ROM drive.
  2. Change to the CD-ROM drive (for example, D: )
  3. Type INSTALL.

The install program will allow you to read OMF's documentation, install
One Must Fall, and install your Epic Bonus games.


Installing One Must Fall
------------------------

Before you can play OMF, you must first install it to your hard drive.

OMF's installation requires approximately 16 MB of hard drive space to
copy all of the files to your hard disk.  The CD is not needed to play 
OMF after installation.


Bonus Games
-----------

Your One Must Fall CD also contains the shareware versions of three other
hot Epic titles: Radix: Beyond The Void, Tyrian, and Jazz Jackrabbit (Turtle
Terror and Holiday Hare).  These games must be installed to your hard
drive before you can play them.


Problems?
---------

If your encounter any problems with your One Must Fall CD, please read the
troubleshooting information in the online manual, either from the INSTALL 
program or by typing HELPME in the OMF directory at the command prompt.


Enjoy!
